{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The\u00a0Demon's Apple</strong> is a Dark Fantasy <strong>Otome game</strong> with <strong>mature content</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pomme is the village herbalist and during one of her outings to pick up herbs used to create medecine she find a badly wounded man and take him home to try to save his life. She then discovers he is a demon, bloodthirsty creature, as he bites her to feed himself before escaping.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But they meet again... And this time they will have to cooperate to <strong>survive in a world hostile to both humans and demons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven chapters of story (about <strong>3 hours of gameplay</strong>)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of diverse characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slightly intimidating <strong>demon love interest</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 20 main CGs, more than doubled if we take into every CGs\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature content</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The characters:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936920/extras/2875b9e5366d96a2bc9eeaabf7899f6d.avif?t=1769116450\" width=1286 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936920/extras/9406da9b84d3d618c326d259d514979c.avif?t=1769116450\" width=1286 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph